ions. Use close_gripper=false or open_gripper=false to inspect arrival before a separate clamp or release. Inspect measured feedback after every call and continue a partial macro from the actual state; never assume later stages ran."},{"name":"setting","value":"rsi_semantic_eef"},{"name":"simulator_package_isaaclab","value":"0.54.3"},{"name":"simulator_package_isaacsim","value":"5.1.0.0"},{"name":"simulator_package_numpy","value":"1.26.4"},{"name":"simulator_package_torch","value":"2.7.0"},{"name":"simulator_package_warp-lang","value":"1.17.0"},{"name":"simulator_python","value":"3.11.17"},{"name":"simulator_software_sha256","value":"b136a750db835961f5356781a1d341054802e6d827c0545daa6bfc76c5995300"}],"schema_version":"l3-public-config-v1"}
